    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Over 60,000 infants in Pakistan are born with Congenital Heart Disease (CHD) each year and over 60 per cent are unable to survive beyond their first few years due to inadequate diagnostic and treatment facilities. With access to quality healthcare, 85 per cent of these children can lead fit, active lives.",
